old #AF87FF]Honest first-paint benchmarks for the Artifacts panes[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bench[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bench: build a pane-level first-paint benchmark over a live-scale [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]synthetic corpus and repair the agent-catalog bench, whose fixture [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]structurally omits the two costs that actually dominate the real [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry load.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop revalidating the agent-name registry on every load[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]registry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bench[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry: make the process-cached registry stop paying a full [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source-signature stat sweep and a full per-entry owner-existence sweep [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on every `load_name_registry()` call, which is 905ms of the Agent pane's[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]1529ms load.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Two-stage Agent pane load[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]agent-paint[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bench[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent-paint: paint the Agent pane from a bounded head slice and move the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full-corpus query-index build into a background extension worker, using [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the shipped Files-pane two-stage pattern.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Direct dict-to-QueryRow corpus construction in sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-corpus[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bench[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-corpus: remove the serde_json::Value intermediate from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`compile_corpus_with_profile` in the sase-core repo so corpus indexing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stops materializing every row twice on the Rust side, then release and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]raise the floor.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Cut the Python-side corpus marshalling cost[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]entry-projection[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bench[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]entry-projection: stop materializing each query row three times on the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Python side and shrink the per-row projection work in the agent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog's query-entry adapter, without changing the row wire shape.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Defer plan metadata reads past the inventory slice[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plans[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bench[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plans: stop reading and YAML-parsing every archived plan file to produce[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fifty rows, and stop computing the rejected section for callers that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]only asked for proposed plans.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Take the external-issue network call off the Bead first-paint [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]path[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]beads[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bench[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads: move the in-band `gh` subprocess out of the Bead snapshot worker [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into a background refresh, and remove the repeated project-alias and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]external-ref work in the same load.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end verification and the perf recipe[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after registry, agent-paint, core-corpus, entry-projection, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]plans, beads[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: confirm the combined first-paint numbers against a live-scale [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]corpus, record the recipe in the perf README, and land the epic's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]combined tree green.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-tt","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-tt.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-2aa94bd285c7ff722f9e7a76ca7db603","started_at":"2026-08-25T19:01:04.149424+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1787690359,"sha":"6ffdfb0a97a976cdadaccf11c29595d5996d4a8f","subject":"feat(artifacts): load agent pane in two stages"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"a114f4d5fdcfdd6ceb186d09c06efb6b13cb780ca6c3d642bda01204b6ed3c9f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-tt.3/chat.md","size_bytes":17494},"commits":{"digest":"cc81a6ee46021cbf8d7741eba51342d02846944638ff58cad211693419f5fc39","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-tt.3/commits.json","size_bytes":224},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-tt.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"526338fb9e199c473eea311192a4edc4f9dd645da19ccd096dbb9a7139de31ca","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-tt.3/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"6793932af278f33b61b53484508c3e0c2283f520290de86a36e63154d4b49b44","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-tt.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":141},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"1e4897141f98723352ba3d4803df8b9f86cccc856a2529fb10270ed1e17569f6","path":"ag